      "message": "This seems odd, its overwriting test-filter-dir with a /data/data path no matter what the original value was.\n\nTracing back through the bugs it appears that the original source of this issue is that tradefed writes to /data/local/tmp, which can\u0027t be accessed by some tests due to selinux.  Would an alternate solution be to write the file to /data/local/tests/unrestricted, which should have less restrictive selinux policies?  Then you don\u0027t need to rewrite the directory to match the test, and don\u0027t need this patch.",
